From 5d3b2fb6a36b0203efb1e7da2e7ea2c66875f8c9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xiaoyao Li <xiaoyao.li@intel.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Jan 2022 21:27:56 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 47/89] i386/tdx: Call KVM_TDX_INIT_VCPU to initialize TDX vcpu

TDX vcpu needs to be initialized by SEAMCALL(TDH.VP.INIT) and KVM
provides vcpu level IOCTL KVM_TDX_INIT_VCPU for it.

