Date: Mon, 15 Jul 2024 04:46:42 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 80/89] i386/tdx: hardcode cpuid leaf 0x2 as what TDX module
 expects

Signed-off-by: Xiaoyao Li <xiaoyao.li@intel.com>
---
